  "summary": "Dane County Sheriff's Office covered its Flock Safety cameras after its contract expired at the end of May, citing privacy concerns and issues reported in nearby Verona. Sheriff Kalvin Barrett said the office wanted to ensure no additional data was collected and is exploring other ALPR options where it would be the sole agency with access.",
  "key_quotes": [
